sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App (error occurs)
    participant Cls as ErrorClassifier
    participant FP as Fingerprinter
    participant Pipe as TelemetryPipeline (Ch 82)
    participant Backend as Backend + routing

    App->>Cls: throwable + context (trace id, Ch 84)
    Cls->>Cls: classify - fatal/non-fatal, transient/permanent, domain
    Cls->>FP: fingerprint - stable signature (Ch 83)
    FP-->>Cls: group key
    Cls->>Pipe: TelemetryEvent (classified, fingerprinted, correlated Ch 84)
    Pipe->>Pipe: redact PII (Ch 28) -> buffer -> batch -> sample by severity (Ch 82)
    Pipe->>Backend: upload (keep all fatals, sample transients)
    Backend->>Backend: dedupe by fingerprint, rank by severity and velocity
    Backend-->>App: fatal + new-in-release + high impact -> PAGE (Ch 83)
    Backend-->>App: transient/expected -> aggregate only
